Synthetic Data Notice
---------------------

The FHIR mCODE sample bundles in this repository are synthetic test data. They
are not real patient records and must not be interpreted as real clinical data.

The mCODE sample bundles were generated with Synthea, an open-source synthetic
patient population simulator made available by The MITRE Corporation. Bundle
metadata may include Synthea identifiers, seeds, organizations, locations, and
references such as https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea.

Synthea software is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

References:

- Synthea: https://synthea.mitre.org/
- Synthea source repository: https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea
- mCODE test data: https://confluence.hl7.org/spaces/COD/pages/80119851/mCODE+Test+Data


